8.1 Functional Requirements

· FR‑4.1 – Maintain digital twin of physical structure (strain, thermal, vibration).
· FR‑4.2 – Perform topology optimisation for structural reinforcements.
· FR‑4.3 – Schedule docking/undocking to minimise centre‑of‑mass perturbation.
