· Digital twin: ANSYS Twin Builder (space‑rated version).

8.4 Performance Targets

· Structural model update: 1 Hz.
· Optimisation job (e.g., truss routing): <10 min (quantum annealer), <1 h (classical).
· Drone response: <100 ms from command to manoeuvre.

