9.1 Functional Requirements

· FR‑3.1 – Material discovery for self‑healing composites and radiation shielding.
· FR‑3.2 – Quantum key distribution (QKD) between habitat and Earth.
· FR‑3.3 – Fuel‑optimal debris avoidance trajectory calculation.
