10. Layer 2: Linux Core Algorithm

10.1 Functional Requirements

· FR‑2.1 – Provide real‑time, secure, open‑source OS on every compute node.
· FR‑2.2 – Enforce mandatory access control (SELinux).
· FR‑2.3 – Support over‑the‑air (OTA) updates with rollback.
· FR‑2.4 – Enable containerised workloads.

10.2 Hardware Specification

· Every node: At minimum, a 64‑bit CPU (ARM, x86, RISC‑V) with MMU.
· Boot ROM: Signed, verified boot.

10.3 Software Stack

· Kernel: Linux 6.x with PREEMPT_RT, patched for space (radiation‑soft error mitigation).
· Distribution: Yocto Project, custom layer.
· Container runtime: containerd, runsc (gVisor) for isolation.
· OTA: OSTree + Aktualizr.

10.4 Performance Targets

· Interrupt latency: <15 µs on real‑time cores.
· OTA update: <5 min per node, 100 Mbps.
· Kernel panic rate: <1 per 10⁵ hours.

