11. Layer 1: Cross‑Platform Abstraction

11.1 Functional Requirements

· FR‑1.1 – Provide a uniform hardware abstraction for all higher layers.
· FR‑1.2 – Support ARM, x86, RISC‑V, and cloud backends.
· FR‑1.3 – Enable live migration of services across ISAs.
· FR‑1.4 – Abstract accelerators (GPU, FPGA, photonic, quantum).

11.2 Hardware Specification

· Hypervisor: Xen or KVM, ported to all target ISAs.
· Firmware: UEFI, OpenSBI for RISC‑V.

11.3 Software Stack

· HAL: Custom C++ library, compiled per platform.
· Bytecode: WebAssembly (WASI) for portable application logic.
· Accelerator abstraction: OpenCL, SYCL, or custom runtime.

11.4 Performance Targets

· Abstraction overhead: <5% for compute‑intensive tasks.
· Migration downtime: <100 ms.
· Supported device drivers: 100% coverage of all onboard peripherals.

