15. Safety and Redundancy

· Fault Tolerance: All critical subsystems (Triad, reactor control, attitude) are triple‑modular redundant.
· Fail‑Safe Modes: Gradual degradation; ultimate safe state = habitation module isolation, thrust to graveyard orbit.
· Emergency Power: 24 h battery, deployable solar arrays (backup).
· Radiation Hardening: Total ionising dose tolerance >100 krad for all electronics; select components >1 Mrad.

